  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional Direct Aid Program Funding for Africa Posts 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional Direct Aid Program funding for Australian Posts in Africa to support small grants working with local communities on projects that reduce poverty and achieve sustainable development consistent with Australia&apos;s national interest. Projects cover a range of sectors including education, health, water and sanitation, environmental protection, women&apos;s empowerment and gender equality, supporting people with disabilities, economic livelihoods, food security and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
